WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.772
MAID — offered death instead of help.

00:00:02.772 --> 00:00:05.613
A Paralympian veteran asked for a wheelchair ramp.

00:00:05.613 --> 00:00:08.318
The government's response: we can help you die.

00:00:08.318 --> 00:00:13.488
At least four to five confirmed cases of veterans being offered MAID by a Veterans Affairs employee.
